  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Well come and well met, my brave little spark",
      "time": "00:32.072",
      "end": "00:38.724",
      "words": [
        "00:32.072",
        "00:32.641",
        "00:33.523",
        "00:33.885",
        "00:34.200",
        "00:35.733",
        "00:36.045",
        "00:36.905",
        "00:37.479"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "How long you've wandered, burned bright as a star",
      "time": "00:39.011",
      "end": "00:44.467",
      "words": [
        "00:39.011",
        "00:39.210",
        "00:39.532",
        "00:39.844",
        "00:41.659",
        "00:41.991",
        "00:42.700",
        "00:42.938",
        "00:43.251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I have awaited you patiently all this time",
      "time": "00:44.820",
      "end": "00:52.593",
      "words": [
        "00:44.820",
        "00:45.181",
        "00:45.832",
        "00:46.386",
        "00:47.651",
        "00:47.996",
        "00:50.019",
        "00:50.267",
        "00:50.905"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Past every fate",
      "time": "00:53.225",
      "end": "00:55.982",
      "words": [
        "00:53.225",
        "00:53.872",
        "00:55.305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now sing with me once more, share of your life",
      "time": "00:56.230",
      "end": "01:04.486",
      "words": [
        "00:56.230",
        "00:56.871",
        "00:57.531",
        "00:57.997",
        "00:58.446",
        "00:59.202",
        "01:00.804",
        "01:01.424",
        "01:01.816",
        "01:02.415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Far greater than memory, its loss and love words cannot hold",
      "time": "01:04.831",
      "end": "01:12.888",
      "words": [
        "01:04.831",
        "01:05.195",
        "01:05.974",
        "01:06.674",
        "01:08.494",
        "01:08.951",
        "01:09.521",
        "01:09.838",
        "01:10.210",
        "01:10.965",
        "01:12.124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Boundless the tale overflows",
      "time": "01:13.249",
      "end": "01:20.392",
      "words": [
        "01:13.249",
        "01:14.705",
        "01:15.137",
        "01:16.255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And carries your light out to sea",
      "time": "01:21.087",
      "end": "01:30.896",
      "words": [
        "01:21.087",
        "01:22.158",
        "01:24.049",
        "01:25.201",
        "01:26.160",
        "01:26.714",
        "01:27.075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember the rain, near and far beloved",
      "time": "01:32.708",
      "end": "01:38.371",
      "words": [
        "01:32.708",
        "01:33.758",
        "01:34.086",
        "01:35.508",
        "01:35.891",
        "01:36.348",
        "01:37.047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Each drop a blessing from heavens above",
      "time": "01:38.744",
      "end": "01:44.469",
      "words": [
        "01:38.744",
        "01:39.031",
        "01:39.385",
        "01:39.813",
        "01:41.577",
        "01:41.869",
        "01:42.923"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And how as time flowed on those waters became one",
      "time": "01:44.760",
      "end": "01:52.737",
      "words": [
        "01:44.760",
        "01:45.008",
        "01:45.703",
        "01:46.064",
