        "01:47.533",
        "01:48.012",
        "01:49.947",
        "01:50.879"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Streams, rivers and lakes",
      "time": "01:53.029",
      "end": "01:56.025",
      "words": [
        "01:53.029",
        "01:53.922",
        "01:55.138",
        "01:55.386"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reaching for the horizon and far beyond",
      "time": "01:56.204",
      "end": "02:04.585",
      "words": [
        "01:56.204",
        "01:56.910",
        "01:57.659",
        "01:58.051",
        "02:00.817",
        "02:01.403",
        "02:02.247"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They carry onward however changed with each brief reflection, by setting sun",
      "time": "02:04.872",
      "end": "02:15.647",
      "words": [
        "02:04.872",
        "02:05.193",
        "02:06.009",
        "02:07.061",
        "02:08.800",
        "02:09.622",
        "02:09.935",
        "02:10.270",
        "02:11.159",
        "02:13.113",
        "02:13.739",
        "02:14.826"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By storm's wake",
      "time": "02:15.992",
      "end": "02:20.624",
      "words": [
        "02:15.992",
        "02:16.949",
        "02:17.907"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "'Til welcomed home to gentle sea",
      "time": "02:20.877",
      "end": "02:32.106",
      "words": [
        "02:20.877",
        "02:22.127",
        "02:24.051",
        "02:25.328",
        "02:26.040",
        "02:27.207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sinking deeper and deeper in calm embrace",
      "time": "02:32.325",
      "end": "02:37.930",
      "words": [
        "02:32.325",
        "02:33.072",
        "02:33.998",
        "02:34.358",
        "02:35.558",
        "02:35.947",
        "02:36.682"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Loving tides sweep in and bear you down",
      "time": "02:38.203",
      "end": "02:43.962",
      "words": [
        "02:38.203",
        "02:38.951",
        "02:39.658",
        "02:40.060",
        "02:40.508",
        "02:41.091",
        "02:41.617",
        "02:41.987"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Should you meet a soul rising surface-ways",
      "time": "02:44.232",
      "end": "02:49.992",
      "words": [
        "02:44.232",
        "02:44.606",
        "02:45.012",
        "02:45.567",
        "02:45.947",
        "02:46.371",
        "02:48.029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With your unbeating heart, wish them well",
      "time": "02:50.265",
      "end": "02:57.470",
      "words": [
        "02:50.265",
        "02:50.577",
        "02:50.962",
        "02:52.476",
        "02:53.208",
        "02:53.651",
        "02:54.252"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep dark, far away, I have heard your voice, weighed your every choice",
      "time": "02:59.961",
      "end": "03:10.548",
      "words": [
        "02:59.961",
        "03:00.661",
        "03:01.812",
        "03:02.286",
        "03:04.793",
        "03:05.145",
        "03:05.627",
        "03:05.914",
        "03:06.768",
        "03:07.839",
        "03:08.175",
        "03:08.567",
        "03:09.687"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now our hands join round the meaning you sought",
      "time": "03:10.857",
      "end": "03:17.471",
      "words": [
        "03:10.857",
        "03:11.185",
        "03:11.549",
        "03:12.581",
        "03:13.280",
        "03:14.045",
        "03:14.945",
        "03:16.218",
        "03:16.408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll catch your tears, quench your fears with joy 'til you near the shore",
      "time": "03:18.073",
      "end": "03:28.540",
      "words": [
        "03:18.073",
        "03:19.666",
        "03:20.075",
        "03:20.581",
        "03:22.792",
        "03:23.134",
        "03:23.542",
        "03:24.168",
        "03:24.625",
        "03:25.825",
        "03:26.146",
        "03:26.620",
        "03:27.111",
        "03:27.586"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Where in time, all shall as hope be reborn, ah",
      "time": "03:28.932",
      "end": "03:39.658",
      "words": [
        "03:28.932",
        "03:29.228",
        "03:29.637",
        "03:30.747",
        "03:31.293",
        "03:32.122",
        "03:32.821",
        "03:34.173",
        "03:34.381",
        "03:36.039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hush, love, close your eyes, and in sleep abide",
      "time": "03:56.794",
      "end": "04:04.637",
      "words": [
        "03:56.794",
        "03:57.626",
        "03:58.826",
        "03:59.074",
        "03:59.560",
        "04:01.969",
        "04:02.299",
        "04:02.712",
        "04:03.131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As sun's distant light, echoes down to dreams below",
      "time": "04:04.925",
      "end": "04:14.604",
      "words": [
        "04:04.925",
        "04:05.198",
        "04:05.753",
        "04:06.715",
        "04:07.877",
        "04:08.594",
        "04:10.572",
        "04:11.865",
        "04:13.163"
      ]
    },
